===Verb===
{{en-verb}}

# {{lb|en|transitive}} To [[measure]] the [[performance]] or [[quality]] of (an item) relative to another similar item in an impartial scientific manner.
## {{lb|en|intransitive|followed by ''at''}} To give certain results in a benchmark test.
## {{lb|en|ambitransitive|followed by ''against''}} To use something (e.g., a competitor's product) as a standard to improve one's own thing.

